      "heading": "What it costs",
      "body": "Nothing. The wmembersocial scope is free, and GitHub Actions minutes are free for public repos.",
      "durationInFrames": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Automation",
      "heading": "Setting up the LinkedIn side",
      "body": "Create an app in the LinkedIn Developer Portal and enable the Sign In with LinkedIn product (see my LinkedIn OAuth client setup guide for the full…",
      "durationInFrames": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Automation",
      "heading": "The 422 trap",
      "body": "The modern posting endpoint, POST /v2/ugcPosts, rejected every request I sent from this app with a 422 error whenever I used a urn:li:person URN.",
      "durationInFrames": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Automation",
      "heading": "Why teasers from frontmatter, not AI",
      "body": "\"Content repurposing AI\" tools promise to rewrite everything. My posts are technical.",
      "durationInFrames": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "Automation",
      "heading": "The thumbnail problem",
      "body": "Each article has an OG card at /og/{slug}.png (1200×630), which the share script attaches as the thumbnail.",
      "durationInFrames": 120
